    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everything about GeckoShop:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>GeckoShop</u> is a Sandbox <strong>Shop Simulator + Creature Collector</strong>, where you manage your own shop, selling all the different varieties of geckos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Your dream of having your own Petshop finally comes true. Get cozy and have a fun time collecting and selling lizards, or grind hard and be the next millionare on this island!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>You'll have to:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal with <strong>customers</strong>, set your own Prices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the store clean and working, or get <strong>Employees</strong> to do it for you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the small <strong>open-world city</strong>, with People to interact with, Quests and other things at every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>Shells and ancient Artifacts</strong> on the beach to <strong>fill the museum</strong>, to unlock even more content as you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept <strong>Quests</strong> from various NPCs on the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch <strong>Thieves</strong> trying to steal from your shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate and upgrade your store, <strong>however you want.\u00a0</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392420/extras/84e8d96bd41af22c128641fa95b943f2.poster.avif?t=1753123284\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392420/extras/84e8d96bd41af22c128641fa95b943f2.webm?t=1753123284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect a big variety of different types and rarities of Lizards.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can sell your pets, or turn your Shop <strong>into a zoo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>hundreds of geckos</strong> for you to unlock, in 4 rarities. Through opening chests, mutating geckos in the Lab, Vending machines, and through sidequests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy and open different Boxes</strong>, to get <strong>random Geckos</strong> from that set, and if you're lucky enough you might even find a Super rare gecko.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392420/extras/4ef220f8ed956b37b0fc92fbd07d4a21.poster.avif?t=1753123284\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392420/extras/4ef220f8ed956b37b0fc92fbd07d4a21.webm?t=1753123284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade, Decorate and Paint your Shop, however you feel like.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hire <strong>Employees</strong> to assist you to sell pets and products, clean trash from your store, and catch thieves before they can steal anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your shop small or upgrade it to the maximum, make a <strong>giant warehouse</strong> full of rare items and animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>Trophies</strong> to display in the Backroom of your Shop, to keep track of your Progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392420/extras/f3957e775257bc15cb15854f85931fe0.poster.avif?t=1753123284\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392420/extras/f3957e775257bc15cb15854f85931fe0.webm?t=1753123284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the City, Mutate Geckos, Eat burgers, Repeat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The City is <strong>full of Surprises</strong>! Check out the <strong>Lab</strong>, where &quot;Zippy Joe&quot; made a machine to mutate 5 geckos into another one, and with some luck you might even get a Lab-exclusive gecko (very rare, they sparke in rainbow colors!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to the <strong>Wrenchshop</strong>, and talk with &quot;Bolt&quot; about upgrading your shop, or go to the <strong>Paintshop</strong> and let &quot;Doodle&quot; paint your whole Shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get yourself a <strong>Companion</strong> from the <strong>Petshop</strong>, or <strong>race</strong> against other geckos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And dont forget to get a <strong>Burger</strong> from the restaurant next to the <strong>Beach</strong>\u00a0;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sidequests everywhere!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might want to go <strong>treasure hunting,</strong> or collect shells and ancient artifacts to keep the <strong>museum</strong> growing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or maybe you want to <strong>catch fishes</strong> all day long and forget about your customers!<br><strong>Sell your fishes</strong> to &quot;Skipper&quot;, but don't worry, you'll see in your <strong>Collection</strong> which fishes you've already catched, and which ones are missing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392420/extras/96a0043f52bf0e4edcfb01a82d078864.avif?t=1753123284\" data-has-big width=800 height=389 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(We are also working on adding Multiple Languages, Full Controller Support, Steam Achievements etc. as soon as possible.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everything about GeckoShop:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>GeckoShop</u> is a Sandbox <strong>Shop Simulator + Creature Collector</strong>, where you manage your own shop, selling all the different varieties of geckos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Your dream of having your own Petshop finally comes true. Get cozy and have a fun time collecting and selling lizards, or grind hard and be the next millionare on this island!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>You'll have to:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal with <strong>customers</strong>, set your own Prices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the store clean and working, or get <strong>Employees</strong> to do it for you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the small <strong>open-world city</strong>, with People to interact with, Quests and other things at every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>Shells and ancient Artifacts</strong> on the beach to <strong>fill the museum</strong>, to unlock even more content as you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept <strong>Quests</strong> from various NPCs on the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch <strong>Thieves</strong> trying to steal from your shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate and upgrade your store, <strong>however you want.\u00a0</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392420/extras/84e8d96bd41af22c128641fa95b943f2.poster.avif?t=1753123284\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392420/extras/84e8d96bd41af22c1286