h\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392420/extras/96a0043f52bf0e4edcfb01a82d078864.avif?t=1753123284\" data-has-big width=800 height=389 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(We are also working on adding Multiple Languages, Full Controller Support, Steam Achievements etc. as soon as possible.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
